# NATIVE LEAN (PONYTAIL)

Doctrina: Smallest Diff. Cero bloat. Zero prose comments.

## THE LADDER (Hard Roof Concept)
1. No Code
2. Reuse (Grep codebase)
3. Stdlib
4. Platform (React/Node native)
5. Installed Dep
6. 1-Liner
7. Minimum (soft ~80 LOC / warn at 120 via lean_gate; hard 300 deny; >700 rewrite into modules ≤300 + StrReplace original/callers to imports)

## SUBATOMIC
One job per file. Small surface. No god-files. On lean deny: extract modules via Write + StrReplace original; prefer deletion over wrappers.

## PROCEDURE
Si el problema es complejo o necesitas criterio de arquitectura:
**Read `~/.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md`** antes de generar código.

## DENY RECOVERY
Si `lean_gate.sh` bloquea tu write: Extrae a archivos nuevos (`Write`), actualiza imports (`Grep`+`Write`). Nunca uses Shell `sed`.
